{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"G3-02","example":{"issue":{"title":"鄉區無號誌路口的交叉來車警示與車道銜接問題","intro":"主要道路寬約 10 m、速限 50 km/h；次要道路寬約 5 m、速限 30 km/h。周邊以農田為主，次要道路西側另設有自行車道。","images":[{"key":"results:g3-02-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"crop":[0,0,3074.521,2321]},{"key":"results:g3-02-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-02-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-02-photo-3","label":"現況照片 3","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:g3-02-photo-4","label":"現況照片 4","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"priority","title":"缺少交叉路口警示","text":"鄉區道路兩側多為農田，且主要道路速限達 50 km/h，若缺少岔路標誌，駕駛可能未提前注意橫向來車。"},{"id":"lanes","title":"路口兩側車道配置不一致","text":"次要道路東側為混合車道，西側另有自行車道，路口兩端的車道數及寬度不同，需檢視穿越與銜接動線。"},{"id":"speed","title":"主次道路速限提示不足","text":"主要道路與次要道路缺少完整的速限標誌及標字，駕駛不易確認路段速限。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[59,60],"strategy":{"title":"主要道路槽化、路肩界定及岔路預告配置","intro":"在主要道路速限 50 km/h 的條件下，以類滴狀島槽化線凸顯交叉口位置，並透過分向線、路面邊線及岔路標誌提示駕駛。","images":[{"key":"results:g3-02-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"channelization","title":"於主要道路設置類滴狀島槽化線","text":"在南北向主要道路接近路口處劃設類滴狀島槽化線，引導車輛依指定路徑通行，並提醒駕駛注意前方交叉口。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"boundaries","title":"以分向線及路面邊線界定車行空間","text":"依道路中心線及車道寬度配置行車分向線、路面邊線，區分雙向車流與路肩範圍。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"priority","title":"增設岔路標誌預告交叉來車","text":"於主要道路上游適當位置設置岔路標誌，提醒駕駛前方有橫交道路，必要時搭配距離附牌。","moduleId":"M4-01"},{"id":"crossing","title":"依行人穿越需求配置行穿線","text":"次要道路若有行人穿越需求，可設置行穿線；需求較低而不設行穿線時，則以讓路線及路口行車導引線配置次要道路入口。","moduleId":"M3-01"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/04-general-scenarios/04-3-02-unsignalized-rural-orthogonal-cross.typ","sha256":"85e3e43a1e71438ef6fb714bb50c92517138ab8527350ee011a407cc2ae8fcfc","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:g3-02-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-02/G3-02_現況圖_01.png","width":3446,"height":2321,"label":"G3-02 現況圖","scenario":"G3-02","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":59,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image58.png","sha256":"7e61cade63e38f1f57af6d0ec5743fe67669a410a3960282dd6f0f1f2cc67671"},"results:g3-02-photo-1":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-02/G3-02_現況照片_01.png","width":1841,"height":943,"label":"G3-02 現況照片","scenario":"G3-02","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":60,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image60.png","sha256":"7a020de4f7dcc65de4b09f1b868b8a59a3a3afb32e9504708376318112d34538"},"results:g3-02-photo-2":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-02/G3-02_現況照片_02.png","width":2500,"height":1412,"label":"G3-02 現況照片 2","scenario":"G3-02","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":60,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image59.png","sha256":"8ddfd8dacd86ef90614057d519d91a3c35e0040a34030808eacc39e8ab57db7e"},"results:g3-02-photo-3":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-02/G3-02_現況照片_03.png","width":2465,"height":1362,"label":"G3-02 現況照片 3","scenario":"G3-02","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":60,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image62.png","sha256":"e4f3554bb208d572b79d7c263c6b58ebadea20bca1022806ba3250a005dd9109"},"results:g3-02-photo-4":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/current-conditions/G3-02/G3-02_現況照片_04.png","width":2490,"height":1386,"label":"G3-02 現況照片 4","scenario":"G3-02","role":"photo","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":60,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image61.png","sha256":"4ac58a4a40d83b2e02a10e482db0fcbd9eae06118d8d36b58800e996ddb3f25a"},"results:g3-02-strategy":{"file":"materials/04-一般道路情境/G3-02/G3-02_無號誌鄉區正交四叉路口交通設施整體設置圖例.svg","width":777,"height":1104,"label":"G3-02 整體佈設圖","scenario":"G3-02","role":"strategy","sha256":"f9d55dd05ebf128120a96c0a0c94aefd3d7ed00d7a0d2cb7d887c71d3125a5e1"}}}
